# NOTE: data/ is intentionally committed (not ignored). It's fully synthetic
# (see Step 1, seeded/reproducible) and small (~1.5MB), and committing it lets
# a fresh clone or a Streamlit Community Cloud deploy boot with a ready-to-go
# demo instead of regenerating the whole pipeline on first load. If you'd
# rather keep this repo reproducible-only, re-add "data/" here and regenerate
# locally via the Usage steps below.

